{"unit_id":"moton16__dsh-msg-edit#card-zh","repo":"moton16/dsh-msg-edit","commit":"b2af7c9c2b62a2713de2499f9869a79054e6771d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@moton16/dsh-msg-edit 是面向 DSH Web 的会话消息编辑插件，通过 Cordis 主机插件提供消息 RPC，并在助手消息操作条加入编辑和重新生成入口。用户可以改写助手回复的正文或思考内容、重新生成对应回复，也可通过主机 RPC 编辑用户文本并从该处重新生成后续对话；编辑器会读取现有回复作为预填内容。它适合需要修订回答或重试生成的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 提供 sessions、agents 与 webServer 服务，并兼容声明的 dsh 版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-25","lib/index.js:50-114","lib/index.js:116-193","lib/client.js:56-187"]}
{"unit_id":"moton16__dsh-msg-edit#card-en","repo":"moton16/dsh-msg-edit","commit":"b2af7c9c2b62a2713de2499f9869a79054e6771d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@moton16/dsh-msg-edit lets DSH Web users edit an assistant reply’s text or reasoning, or regenerate it from its user prompt. A host RPC can also edit user text and replace the following conversation. It requires DSH Web session, agent, and web server services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-25","lib/index.js:50-114","lib/index.js:116-193","lib/client.js:56-187"]}
